[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.83, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "嗯，我們來看看能做什麼菜。我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12088.63, "timestamp": "03:21:28", "text": "，事情太多了。蛋糕、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12092.229, "timestamp": "03:21:32", "text": "牛奶、雞蛋、蜂蜜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.79, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "蔬菜蛋糕在哪兒？肉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12098.95, "timestamp": "03:21:38", "text": "酥脆的肉。猛獁象奶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12102.309, "timestamp": "03:21:42", "text": "。那麼，如何才能弄到牛奶呢？蛋。淺色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12113.91, "timestamp": "03:21:53", "text": "哦，是的。接下來我們要找的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12117.59, "timestamp": "03:21:57", "text": "是木板。"}]